<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5675"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 8:52 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have wanted so badly to post something of significance on this thread - but, alas, I can&#39;t. <BR> <BR>It&#39;s a wonderful topic - and insightful.   <BR> <BR>But, I rarely see a movie.  I think Forrest Gump was the last one.  I read a lot, however, and I think that some of the books these movies were based on - are relevent. <BR> <BR>After reading the list - I am going to rent Se7en.  I&#39;ll have to watch it between my fingers. <BR> <BR>Thanks for a good topic.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
